OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPartly
OL,6,Fcloudy with plenty of clear spells
OL,7,Fovernight, leading to patchy mist and
OL,8,Ffog developing, mainly in rural areas.
OL,9,FLight winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CFriday:FAny mist and fog clear through
OL,12,Fthe morning to give a reasonable
OL,13,Fafternoon with sunny spells. Fog
OL,14,Flikely to redevelop overnight. Light
OL,15,Fwinds. Mild by day, chilly overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
