OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FA
OL,6,Freasonable afternoon on Saturday once
OL,7,Fovernight fog clears. Cloudy with some
OL,8,Flight rain on Sunday. Becoming dry and
OL,9,Fpartly cloudy into Monday. Light
OL,10,Fwinds. Temperatures near normal.
